@title Wiring: a wire too large for its terminal is a red triangle on the wire end
@area Check
# T5: the fixture terminal takes 0.5-2.5 mm2 and a 6 mm2 wire is on it. The triangle sits on the pin the wire lands on, not on the whole wire or symbol; the Terminals drawer shows the same triangle in front of the Accepts figures; a click opens the popover with Locate and Waive.
open qa/fixtures/connection-points.novo
wait 30
shot wire-end-on-drawing
check_layout
key ctrl+k
text Terminals
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Accepts"
expect "Error: Wire size at terminal"
shot wire-end-in-drawer
check_layout
click_text "Error: Wire size at terminal" Button
wait 6
expect "Locate"
expect "Waive"
shot wire-end-popover
check_layout
key Escape
wait 4
expect_not "Locate"
